    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be21c506d39e2eba407ee46d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "应该就能理解我的感受了。\n能够理解胜利的喜悦，\n能够理解那最棒的心情……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be05b5a6b846470dc62875957f95e2a9767f25410223b904d83c218de586b7f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        84,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/84/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e53844864b149f74f98c392",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――渐渐地，在心中蔓延开来。\n那是，过去胜利的瞬间……\n那份喜悦，灼热得令人晕眩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0187f7ddda464097e6f4d33fb346fe05821b2e7ce00329aafddc44b82a26db06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
