      "uid": "zhcn:9ec82ee91e20a3e01e02821c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "充实、希望、喜悦…… 被这些感情直接碰撞，\n本不存在的憧憬――被引了出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f9099d2a1877e48c1d67d9353762bd01444a40c07c5c48c90d76dc91bd4eabf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
