      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为此要得到与她并肩的力量……\n要建立打心底认为她的胜利也是自己的自信才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c29b4498eb13821deb2e5ea0b5c16b2b403eb0728015ec78934d0c041607c90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
