    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0317805e514bb80ce9feb19a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有的孩子会被气势吞噬，变得害怕比赛。\n反之，也有被过度激发好胜心，\n导致平时训练里就用力过猛的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eb2503bbb03bc94efc41e0644254af79f217a8ecf3ddc6462198836498b9193",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
